  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "AgentChatApp serves as the primary controller for the interactive, multi-turn chat UI, built using prompt_toolkit. It manages the lifecycle of the chat session, coordinating user input, the agent's asynchronous thinking process, and the terminal display. It bridges the synchronous UI event loop with the background agent execution thread, handling state transitions, command parsing, and filesystem interactions like file mention expansion."
